@startuml post-manager-auth-login
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/manager/v1/auth/login
caption CRB-35 · IdP code 교환, admin_account 허용 목록 확인, 매니저 토큰 발급

actor Client
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerAuthController" as Controller
participant "ManagerAuthService" as Service
participant "InfoteamIdpService" as IdpService
participant "AdminAccountRepository" as AdminAccountRepository
database PostgreSQL
participant "Infoteam IdP" as IdP

Client -> Pipe: POST /api/manager/v1/auth/login\n{ code, redirect_uri, code_verifier }
note right of Client: 가드 없음 (Authorization 불필요). 호출 순서는 flow/admin-login.puml
alt body 검증 실패 (누락 · 빈 문자열)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: login(req)
Controller -> Service: login(code, redirect_uri, code_verifier)

== IdP 확인 (timeout 5초) ==

Service -> IdpService: exchangeAuthorizationCode(code, redirect_uri, code_verifier)
IdpService -> IdP: POST /oauth/token\n{ grant_type, client_id, client_secret, code, redirect_uri, code_verifier }
alt IdP가 4xx (잘못되거나 재사용된 code, redirect_uri · verifier 불일치)
  IdpService -[#red]-> Client: 401 Failed to exchange authorization code
else 5xx · 타임아웃 · 네트워크 오류
  IdpService -[#red]-> Client: 500 An unexpected error occurred. (Slack 알림)
end
IdP --> IdpService: { access_token }

IdpService -> IdP: GET /oauth/userinfo\nAuthorization: Bearer <idp access token>
alt IdP가 401
  IdpService -[#red]-> Client: 401 Failed to fetch IdP user info
else 그 외 오류 · 타임아웃
  IdpService -[#red]-> Client: 500 An unexpected error occurred. (Slack 알림)
end
IdP --> IdpService: { sub, email, ... }
IdpService --> Service: { email }

== 허용 목록 확인 ==

Service -> Service: email trim + 소문자 변환
alt email 없음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 This account is not allowed as a manager.
end
Service -> AdminAccountRepository: findByEmail(email)
AdminAccountRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT admin_account WHERE email = ?
PostgreSQL --> AdminAccountRepository: row
AdminAccountRepository --> Service: account | null
alt 계정 없음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 This account is not allowed as a manager.
end

== 매니저 토큰 발급 ==

Service -> Service: 서명 (RS256, JwtKeyService.privateKey,\nissuer = "Cheers-Manager", 수명 1일, 클레임 sub = account.pk)
note right of Service
  사용자 토큰과 키는 같고 issuer만 다름.
  role은 넣지 않음 (ManagerGuard가 DB에서 읽음).
  refresh token 없음
end note
Service --> Controller: { accessToken }
Controller --> Client: 201 { access_token }

@enduml
